WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.300
He will betray you, without fail.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.180
I know this for a fact.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.160
Because I originally came from Academia myself.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:16.650
My interactions with the 
people of City changed me.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:21.400
From the bottom of my heart, 
I wish to build a perfect world.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.870
To make that a reality, I need you.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.850
Trust in me, Yuya!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.640
D-Wheels.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.790
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.450
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.890
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:45.050
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.990
The Ultimate Falcon Versus 
the Black-Winged Lightning

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:35.680
Crow has no cards left 
on his side of the field.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.070
How will he fight back?

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.540
I'm only getting started!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.800
Hurry it up.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.880
After I beat you, I have more enemies to defeat.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.850
Quit underestimating the bonds 
between Commons!

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:49.950
My turn!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:53.870
Go, Crow!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:54.840
Beat him!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:55.870
Fight hard!

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.040
It's no use. He can't hear us.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.820
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.340
Don't let that Kurosaki guy beat you!

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.300
If you won't come to me, I'll come to you!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.970
I don't think so.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.200
When there are no monsters on my field,

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.210
I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:21.660
Tuner Monster Blackwing — 
Gofu the Vague Shadow.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.560
When I Special Summon Gofu 
the Vague Shadow,

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:36.390
I summon two Vague Shadow 
Tokens in attack position!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.200
My preparations are complete.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:47.510
Level 5 Gofu the Vague Shadow tunes the 
two Level 1 Vague Shadow Tokens!

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:52.670
When I use Gofu the Vague Shadow 
as a synchro component,

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:56.280
I can Synchro Summon from my 
graveyard, not my Extra Deck!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.220
From your graveyard?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:02.700
Spread your ebony wings, and strike the 
ground with the speed of lightning!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.290
Phantom Synchro!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:09.370
Rain down, Assault Blackwing 
— Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:13.770
Incredible! He took his ace from the 
graveyard with a Synchro Summon!

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:17.580
We Commons aren't like you Tops.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:22.110
We can't put as many ace monsters 
as we want in our Extra Decks.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:26.080
But we won't let our cards die easily, either.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.550
We Commons live our lives, 
treasuring every card we get!

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:34.120
No matter how many times it revives, 
I'll send it back to the graveyard.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.790
I've crawled back from death's door 
more times than you ever could!

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:43.160
Will you work with me, Yuya?

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.050
No, I—

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.070
Why not?

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:48.990
The Lancers' objective is to work with City

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:52.100
to prevent an interdimensional 
war with Academia, isn't it?

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.540
Yes, but...

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:58.510
At the moment, City's Administrative 
Council is not functioning.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:04:59.980
That's because of you!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:05.080
I resorted to force because we 
have no time left to lose.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.450
Academia is already on the move.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:13.290
And that man, Dennis Mackfield, is already...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.380
To keep him away from Serena, 
I returned him to Academia.

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.980
Dennis has returned to Academia.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.260
He must have already told them 
Yuzu and Serena are here.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:32.240
That is the indisputable proof that Sora 
and Dennis are working together.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.040
You're wrong! Sora is my—

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.390
He is no friend of yours...

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.720
He is from Academia.

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:43.220
He's been raised to never refuse 
an order from the Professor.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:45.870
Yuzu!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.690
She isn't here...

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.830
Where did she go?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.160
I should have never let her out of my sight.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.420
All this security...

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.370
Are they looking for Yuzu, since she 
lost in the tournament?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:04.970
But why?

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.050
Crow!

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:16.020
Those kids... It's dangerous to be up there!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.500
Crow!

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:20.810
Make sure you don't fall!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.130
You'd better win!

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.240
Yuzu? What's she doing there?

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:36.480
I activate Raikiri the Rain—

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:37.420
Enough!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.440
What?

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.110
This duel is over!

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.150
Give me a break! I can't stop now!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.380
I activate Raikiri the Rain Shower's effect.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:50.650
Once per turn, for each Blackwing 
on my side of the field,

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:52.290
I destroy one of your cards!

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.260
I destroy your Blaze Falcon!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:59.350
I activate my Counter Trap 
Raidraptor — Reversal!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:02.220
When there's a Raidraptor on my field,

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.970
I can negate its destruction and draw one card!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.830
Darn! He tried to finish it too fast, I guess.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.360
Where's Tanner?

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.370
He's gone?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.550
Maybe the bathroom?

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.340
Yuzu Hiiragi and

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.910
Serena... We must work 
together to protect them.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:32.200
I shall take them into custody, 
and look after them myself.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.440
Into custody?

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:38.430
If I have them both close at hand, 
Academia cannot make a move.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.140
You're going to use them?!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:44.040
In that respect, I am no different 
than Reiji Akaba, am I?

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:48.410
He must have let Serena into the Lancers, 
knowing she was with Academia.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:52.250
Likely, to use her as a bargaining 
chip with the enemy.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:56.450
I have no intention of making any 
such trade with Academia...

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:59.620
I'm going to stop the war, 
with my way of dueling!

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:03.860
Naturally, I agree that that would be ideal.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:10.080
If you can see your ideals through 
and bring peace to the world,

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.710
that would be the best possible ending.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.840
If you want to end it, end it!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.540
I'm gonna give this my all.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:23.260
I activate my Equip Spell Sky Excalibur on Raikiri!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:31.030
It increases the equipped monster's 
attack points by 400!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.840
Stop it! Listen to me!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.330
Shut up! I declare battle!

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.560
Raikiri the Rain Shower attacks Rise Falcon!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:46.520
He took a lot of Kurosaki's life points at once!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.940
That reborn ace is really showing its stuff!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.410
Then, I'll have to resort to force.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:55.510
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic Raptor's Force.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:00.780
This turn, I Special Summon the Blaze 
Falcon that was destroyed by battle!

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.010
I use it as an overlay component,

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:07.750
and summon a Raid Raptor of one rank higher!

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.260
Another rank?

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:15.430
Proud falcon, flap your wings that are 
stained with the blood of heroes,

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.010
and travel the path of revolution.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.920
Rank Up Xyz Change.

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:26.480
Appear, Rank 6 Raidraptor — Revolution Falcon!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:31.690
To deal with Crow, who brought 
back his destroyed monster,

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:35.860
Kurosaki revives his own monster, 
one rank higher than before!

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:40.780
When Revolution Falcon is ranked up, 
using a Raidraptor as a component,

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:43.710
I destroy one monster you've Special Summoned,

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.330
and deal half its attack points as damage to you.

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:57.710
A monster equipped with Sky Excalibur 
cannot be targeted by your effects!

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:02.100
Damn you! Why can't you understand?!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.720
Tanner!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.790
What's happening here?!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:14.260
There's a child clinging to Raikiri's back!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.730
That's where Tanner ended up?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.900
I-I'm gonna fall!

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.320
What do we do?

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:26.370
During the duel, the bikes are on 
autopilot, so they can't stop.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.840
Tanner, what were you thinking? Stupid!

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.960
I'll set you down, somehow, 
with Frank and the others!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.810
Until then, hang in there, Tanner!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.020
Hang on a little longer!

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.220
I promise I'll catch Tanner!

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.740
I can't...

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.560
Tanner!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.740
Kurosaki... Why?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:00.840
I, too...

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:16.590
Kurosaki, thank you!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.260
Kurosaki...

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:34.110
I never thought I'd see Kurosaki 
do something like that.

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:48.490
"I, too, had children who cheered 
for me," Kurosaki said.

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:50.100
He's...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.660
Oh, no.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:52.890
Kurosaki...

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:58.160
I wonder if Kurosaki's a lot like Crow.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.400
He's scary on the surface,

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.870
but maybe he really likes children like us.

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:09.360
You saw it from the start.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.680
That's why you said that.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:13.810
Thanks, okay?

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.780
And I thank you, as well.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.810
When I saw you and the children,

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:24.920
I remembered what it is that I'm fighting for.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:29.390
For the sake of my homeland's children, 
I will destroy all my enemies.

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:34.870
So you have something important 
that you have to protect, too?

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:40.510
But the Academia you're trying to fight 
is an unbelievably huge enemy, right?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:45.370
And you've been fighting a powerful enemy 
known as the Tops, correct?

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:48.800
Yeah... We've got a lot in common, I guess.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:50.010
It appears we do.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.480
I now end my turn.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:54.950
Now, give it all you've got!

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:57.190
You don't need to tell me.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:02.680
Those two...

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:14.170
The two warmhearted men saved a 
child who'd fallen onto a monster.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:17.680
Which means the duel is 
about to heat up, I bet!

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:19.380
My turn!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:23.110
I activate Rank-Up-Magic Skip Force!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:27.600
I use Revolution Falcon, on my side of 
the field, as an overlay component!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:31.610
I Xyz Summon a Raidraptor two ranks higher!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.200
Two ranks higher?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.860
I guess that's how a veteran duels...

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:40.360
Proud falcon, be wreathed in the fires of rage,

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.430
and become a bolt that scorches 
the ground beneath!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:46.000
Rank Up Xyz Change.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:51.780
Take flight, Rank 8 Raidraptor — 
Satellite Cannon Falcon!

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:55.780
Two 3000-attack-point monsters!

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:59.960
We have the same attack points, 
but we'll just see how it goes.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.240
I'm not finished yet!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.280
What?

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:06.290
By sending Rank-Up-Magic 
Raid Force to my graveyard,

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.260
I can add one Rank-Up-Magic 
from my graveyard to my hand.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:16.370
I add Rank-Up-Magic Skip Force 
to my hand, and I activate it!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.960
Using Satellite Cannon Falcon 
as the component, I overlay!

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:30.160
Ultimate falcon, inherit the will 
of your many comrades,

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.380
and fly to the sky of victory!

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:35.120
Rank Up Xyz Change.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:40.590
Appear, Level 10 Raidraptor — Ultimate Falcon!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.590
Even more attack points!

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:47.060
A new, astonishing development in 
the Synchro versus Xyz matchup!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.770
I activate Ultimate Falcon's effect.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.230
I use one Overlay Unit to negate

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:56.400
all card effects on your side of the 
field until the end of my turn,

00:14:56.400 --> 00:15:00.260
and reduce your monsters' 
attack points by 1000!

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.400
Battle!

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.880
Ultimate Falcon attacks Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.100
Final Glorious Pride!

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.510
Kurosaki's incredible.

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.940
You fight, too, Crow!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:35.510
When Raikiri, Phantom Synchro Summoned 
with Gofu as a component, is destroyed,

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.480
it returns to my Extra Deck!

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:42.460
On the End Phase of the turn where 
I ranked up Ultimate Falcon,

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:47.990
using a Raidraptor as a component, I reduce 
all your monsters' attack points by 1000.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:52.460
But if you have no monsters, 
I deal 1000 damage to you!

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:55.430
If this goes through, Crow will be out of life!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.360
I activate the effect of Sky Excalibur,

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:01.040
which was sent to the graveyard 
with Raikiri's destruction.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:05.510
I Special Summon one Winged Beast 
Tuner Monster from my graveyard!

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:07.900
Come out, Oroshi the Squall!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:14.140
But Ultimate Falcon's effect reduces 
its attack points by 1000!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.490
I end my turn!

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:18.120
Crow managed to hang in there,

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:22.690
but the effect decreased the attack points of 
the monster he Special Summoned to 0.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.660
He has no cards in his Spell and Trap Zones!

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:27.160
None in his hand!

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.400
Everything is riding on this draw!

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.370
Go, Crow!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.340
My turn!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.740
Draw!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.410
It's here!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.110
When there's a Blackwing 
on my side of the field,

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:47.300
I can Special Summon Blackwing
 — Bora the Spear!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:54.170
Level 1 Oroshi the Squall tunes 
Level 4 Bora the Spear!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:59.380
Ebony gale, become the tailwind 
that binds us together!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.230
Synchro Summon!

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:06.760
Fly high, Assault Blackwing — 
Sohaya the Rain Storm!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.910
When I Synchro Summon 
Sohaya the Rain Storm,

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:14.680
I can Special Summon one Assault 
Blackwing from my graveyard.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.840
Come out, Sayo the Rain Hider!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:22.160
And when Sohaya the Rain Storm is used as a 
Blackwing component in a Synchro Summon,

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.260
it counts as a Tuner Monster.

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:30.250
Level 5 Sohaya the Rain Storm tunes 
Level 2 Sayo the Rain Hider!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.300
Synchro Summon!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:37.670
Rain down, Assault Blackwing 
— Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:44.510
Crow's ace monster, Raikiri the 
Rain Shower is back again!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.980
I activate Raikiri the Rain Shower's effect.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:51.840
For every Blackwing on my side of the 
field, I destroy one of your cards!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.920
Naturally, I target Ultimate Falcon!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.920
If that's what you're after, I'm sorry 
to disappoint you.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:05.580
Ultimate Falcon doesn't take 
effects from your cards!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.830
Thought so.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:12.890
I guessed that from the fact that you 
didn't go for an Action Card.

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:14.120
What next, then?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:14.970
Just you watch.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:19.220
I activate the effect of Sohaya the 
Rain Storm in my graveyard.

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:24.440
By banishing it, I Special Summon another 
Sohaya the Rain Storm from my graveyard!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:36.160
When used as a Blackwing component, 
Raikiri is treated as a Tuner Monster.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:41.210
Acting as a Tuner, Level 7 
Raikiri the Rain Shower

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.990
tunes Level 5 Sohaya the Rain Storm!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:50.250
Ebony wings, let the lightning's 
power fill you, and strike!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.340
Synchro Summon!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:03.560
Slice through, Assault Blackwing 
— Onimaru the Divine Thunder!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.180
Incredible! Level 12!

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:09.730
He Synchro Summoned it 
at the highest level!

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:12.380
With three Synchro Summons in one turn,

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.600
he summons a Level 12 Synchro 
Monster that outstrips

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:18.700
even his previous ace monster, 
Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.200
Battle!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:23.810
Onimaru the Divine Thunder 
destroys Ultimate Falcon.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:29.510
When Onimaru the Divine Thunder attacks, 
its attack points increase by 1000

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:32.420
for every Synchro Summon this turn!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.870
Let's finish this...

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.460
Feel the power of the bonds between Commons!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.510
Thunderbolt Flap!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.940
Crow is the winner!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.860
Yeah!

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.360
The winner, Crow, returns triumphantly.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.610
Let's give him a big round of applause!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.100
Yeah!

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.550
I can't just watch anymore...

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:25.770
I wanna fight, too!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:44.790
I will crawl my way back up, 
and eliminate my enemies.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:48.720
You should defeat your enemies, too.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.000
Yeah, I'll hit 'em hard.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.100
Kurosaki!

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:01.190
You're one of us.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.230
Crow... Kurosaki...

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:19.680
I really—

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.760
I saw Yuzu Hiiragi on the course. 
Capture her immediately.

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:25.230
No!

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.160
I won't let you!

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.550
I won't let you have Yuzu!

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:38.580
Sora won't give Yuzu to Academia, either!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.550
Yuzu, Sora, and I are friends!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:43.510
I trust my friends!

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:51.400
He doesn't trust me, then?

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:53.460
What a shame.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.740
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:01.670
I need to find Yuzu, quickly!

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:52.680
Yuzu Hiiragi sighted! We have her surrounded!

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:54.510
We're taking her into custody now.

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:56.080
Security's after me?

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:58.850
Don't tell me... 
They're sending me underground?

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:00.220
Fusion Summon!

00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:03.620
Come out, Frightfur Chimera!

00:24:03.620 --> 00:24:05.800
Sora, what are you doing here?

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:09.560
Forget that... Right now, we need 
to find a way out!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:14.130
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Bond Between Student and Teacher.

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:16.200
The fun is only getting started!
